1
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:12,320
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,800
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,480
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:21,680
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:25,800
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,280
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,200
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:39,400
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,600
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:45,320
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:48,680
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,000
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,400
=Episode 18=

15
00:01:01,719 --> 00:01:02,840
(A half-step Earth Immortal.)

16
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,840
(Nearly two major realms above me.)

17
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:07,319
(Must I surrender the spirit crystals?)

18
00:01:10,239 --> 00:01:10,959
Brat.

19
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,200
See that?

20
00:01:12,519 --> 00:01:15,079
It's not too late to regret this.

21
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:16,319
Regret it?

22
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:18,920
I never regret anything.

23
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,879
This is the perfect chance

24
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:22,879
to learn from you, Senior.

25
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,640
Well, well.

26
00:01:26,159 --> 00:01:28,120
You saw my true manifestation,

27
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,400
and you still dare draw your sword.

28
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:30,840
You have guts.

29
00:01:31,359 --> 00:01:31,840
Today,

30
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:34,319
if I don't teach you a proper lesson,

31
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:36,840
you'll never take me seriously.

32
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:55,200
Well.

33
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,200
Minor Perfection Realm?

34
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,200
My, my.

35
00:01:58,239 --> 00:01:59,519
How rare.

36
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,280
Who would've thought someone so young

37
00:02:01,439 --> 00:02:03,359
could reach this level of cultivation?

38
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:04,719
A pity.

39
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,000
Against me,

40
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:08,039
you still fall a little short.

41
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:08,919
Again.

42
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:25,440
Hahaha.

43
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,240
Who would've thought?

44
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,039
You've only been
on Sword Immortal Island

45
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,639
for ten days,

46
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:32,759
yet reached full mastery
of the Heavenburn Sword Art.

47
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,520
What a prodigy.

48
00:02:35,039 --> 00:02:35,840
Unfortunately,

49
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:38,080
the gap between our realms

50
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:41,000
cannot be bridged by technique.

51
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:42,159
Next,

52
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,080
do not blink.

53
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,639
Boy.

54
00:02:58,039 --> 00:02:59,439
Whatever tricks remain,

55
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,919
use them all.

56
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:02,319
(The gap between our realms
is too wide.)

57
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,439
(I have no choice but to use it.)

58
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:23,719
That...

59
00:03:24,319 --> 00:03:25,319
Solitude?

60
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:27,240
Boy.

61
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:28,439
Could it be...

62
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,599
Is this precious sword already

63
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,840
yours to command?

64
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:37,560
So you know this sword.

65
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,120
It must be quite famous.

66
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,199
Far more than famous.

67
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,319
Its origins are extraordinary.

68
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,479
It just devours minds, right?

69
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:48,000
Did those three little girls

70
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:48,800
on the island tell you?

71
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,159
What do they know?

72
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,120
Little girls?

73
00:03:53,159 --> 00:03:54,240
They are renowned

74
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,759
Earth Immortals of Shenwu Continent.

75
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,639
You merely look older.

76
00:03:57,879 --> 00:03:59,400
You're not actually older than them,
are you?

77
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,520
I... I...

78
00:04:03,479 --> 00:04:04,360
Listen here.

79
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,000
Those three girls

80
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:07,960
must call me Senior Martial Uncle.

81
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:08,960
What?

82
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,560
What's wrong with me
calling them little girls?

83
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:12,879
Senior Martial Uncle?

84
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,279
A thousand years ago,

85
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,360
I had a junior brother.

86
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,600
He was exceptionally gifted

87
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:22,600
and soon reached
the True Immortal Realm.

88
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:25,680
None beneath Heaven could rival him.

89
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:28,959
While he studied the Heavenly Dao,

90
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,040
he suddenly saw true qi

91
00:04:31,199 --> 00:04:32,639
gather between Heaven and Earth.

92
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:35,839
It took the form of this sword.

93
00:04:35,959 --> 00:04:39,160
It was utterly without equal,

94
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:41,800
so he named it Solitude.

95
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,879
Strictly speaking,

96
00:04:44,279 --> 00:04:45,959
it is more than a divine sword.

97
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:47,879
It should be considered

98
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,959
a divine decree.

99
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:51,920
Yes.

100
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:54,079
A decree from the Heavenly Dao.

101
00:04:54,279 --> 00:04:55,639
A decree from the Heavenly Dao?

102
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:57,680
Boy.

103
00:04:57,959 --> 00:05:00,800
Do you know the great tribulation?

104
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:01,920
The great tribulation?

105
00:05:02,839 --> 00:05:04,240
Is that the cycle of the Heavenly Dao

106
00:05:04,399 --> 00:05:06,040
that can destroy everything?

107
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,399
Does this thing actually exist?

108
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,040
Of course.

109
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:09,720
Why?

110
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:10,959
Do you think

111
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:13,279
I'd make something like that up?

112
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,680
Then what does this decree

113
00:05:16,879 --> 00:05:18,160
command its wielder to do?

114
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,000
Do not ask.

115
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,879
You need not know yet.

116
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:22,920
When the time is right,

117
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:24,480
you will understand.

118
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:26,519
What you must know is,

119
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,240
my junior brother

120
00:05:28,879 --> 00:05:32,680
refused to carry out the decree.

121
00:05:33,079 --> 00:05:33,680
Thus,

122
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,920
even if you reach
the True Immortal Realm,

123
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,720
you'll still end up dead,

124
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:40,399
your Dao destroyed.

125
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,480
Who would have thought

126
00:05:42,639 --> 00:05:44,800
that the Solitude Sword

127
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:47,000
would now fall into your hands?

128
00:05:47,959 --> 00:05:48,720
That terrifying?

129
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:50,759
Then I do not want it.

130
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,439
What?

131
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:51,920
No.

132
00:05:51,959 --> 00:05:53,360
You cannot simply discard it.

133
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,920
This sword has already

134
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:58,199
merged with your soul and bloodline.

135
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,680
Unless you die,

136
00:05:59,879 --> 00:06:02,360
you can never be rid of it.

137
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,160
I want it.

138
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,399
Of course I do.

139
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:08,120
I have a blood feud to avenge.

140
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:10,120
I finally found a worthy weapon.

141
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:11,680
Why would I discard it?

142
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:14,920
Finally, an honest answer.

143
00:06:15,759 --> 00:06:16,120
Very well.

144
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:18,079
For the sword's sake,

145
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,079
I will overlook what happened

146
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:23,160
with the spirit vein.

147
00:06:24,399 --> 00:06:25,399
Thank you, Senior.

148
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,800
Do not thank me yet.

149
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,160
A word of warning.

150
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:33,759
Spiritual energy is scarce these days.

151
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:36,319
You possess so many spirit crystals,

152
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:39,199
yet you haven't reached
the highest realms yet.

153
00:06:39,519 --> 00:06:41,319
Others will covet them.

154
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:43,959
Why not

155
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:46,800
take them out now

156
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:47,879
before me,

157
00:06:48,079 --> 00:06:49,480
and absorb them all?

158
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:51,279
Absorb them all?

159
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:52,920
Senior,

160
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,199
I currently have

161
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,839
over a million spirit crystals.

162
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,720
Absorbing them all

163
00:06:57,959 --> 00:06:59,480
would take three to five years.

164
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,079
That...

165
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,240
Young man.

166
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:03,560
Do not sell yourself short.

167
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,560
Do you remember

168
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,680
absorbing my spirit vein?

169
00:07:06,839 --> 00:07:09,639
It took you only one night.

170
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:12,240
With a little effort,

171
00:07:12,439 --> 00:07:13,680
you will manage just fine.

172
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,120
Come, follow me.

173
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:19,240
I will guard you.

174
00:07:32,839 --> 00:07:33,920
(His Dao Bone)

175
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:36,079
(is the Demon Ancestor's
sacred-grade Dao Bone.)

176
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,600
(And his cultivation art)

177
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,079
(is the Nine Heavens Codex.)

178
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,519
(With Solitude in his hand,)

179
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,959
(he is most likely)

180
00:07:43,319 --> 00:07:45,319
(the one who starts
the great tribulation.)

181
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:52,560
Boy.

182
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,800
How do you feel?

183
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:55,639
Senior.

184
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,680
I can't believe that
in just a few dozen days,

185
00:07:57,879 --> 00:07:59,600
I absorbed and refined

186
00:07:59,759 --> 00:08:00,319
a million spirit crystals.

187
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:01,439
Even I

188
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,959
find it terrifying.

189
00:08:03,839 --> 00:08:05,319
You have seen nothing yet,

190
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,439
and you are already scared?

191
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:07,759
Look again.

192
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,720
What is this?

193
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:21,000
These are all spirit crystals.

194
00:08:21,279 --> 00:08:23,319
They are my life savings,

195
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:26,839
gathered through years of hard work.

196
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,759
All together,

197
00:08:28,959 --> 00:08:31,319
there are over three million.

198
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,159
You seem to be in good shape.

199
00:08:35,639 --> 00:08:36,080
Hurry.

200
00:08:36,399 --> 00:08:38,080
Absorb them all.

201
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,039
Over three million?

202
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,440
That exceeds a whole sect's resources.

203
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:45,519
But Senior,

204
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,480
you worked hard to save these.

205
00:08:47,799 --> 00:08:48,559
If you give me everything,

206
00:08:49,039 --> 00:08:49,639
what about you?

207
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,279
Enough with the polite act.

208
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,600
Spare me the nonsense.

209
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:56,440
Anyway, my cultivation in this life

210
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:57,799
has reached its limit.

211
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,879
I will never advance further.

212
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:02,039
Keeping these crystals

213
00:09:02,279 --> 00:09:03,080
would serve no purpose.

214
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,360
But you are different.

215
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:07,159
Your potential is limitless.

216
00:09:07,759 --> 00:09:08,600
Don't be so polite.

217
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,559
Do as I say.

218
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:12,320
Absorb them all.

219
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,279
Understood.

220
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:35,880
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

221
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:39,280
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

222
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,880
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

223
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,840
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

224
00:09:46,680 --> 00:09:49,000
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

225
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:52,280
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

226
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:55,520
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

227
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:58,320
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

228
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:02,520
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

229
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:06,040
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

230
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:09,040
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

231
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:12,080
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

232
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:26,360
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

233
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:29,360
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

234
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:33,000
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

235
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:36,920
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

236
00:10:37,920 --> 00:10:41,200
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

237
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:44,280
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

238
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:47,800
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

239
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:51,960
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

240
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,960
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

241
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:59,440
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

242
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:02,680
♪With this flesh and soul♪

243
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:06,040
♪I shall forge a new age♪

244
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:09,320
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

245
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:12,760
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

246
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:15,320
♪At cultivation's peak♪

247
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:18,040
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

248
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:22,440
♪The sun and moon turn♪

249
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:25,840
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

250
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:31,320
♪I am the undying flame♪

251
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:37,760
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

252
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:41,080
♪At last I see, immortality♪

253
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:45,920
♪Lives in your smiles♪
